I’m Done

[en.EVENT_C18_MAIN_31_o1]
Next Page

[en.EVENT_C18_MAIN_31_o2]
Prev Page

[en.EVENT_C18_MAIN_32]
Talk Record: Burnt Umber

[en.EVENT_C18_MAIN_32_desc]
Burnt Umber, §2Kirin military leader§!, born in the Peaks of Peril, currently residing in the §2Peaks of Peril§!.

As a military leader, Burnt Umber seems to lack the ability to deal with serious conversation. Seeing the investigation team coming, Burnt Umber was very §2nervous and stuttered§!. He seemed to mistake the investigation team for some examiners, and kept emphasizing his loyalty and execution. Because the §2military he led did not participate in§! the transfer of the foal’s breath to the east, his answer to most of our routine questions was “I don’t know”. This made him even more nervous, and the investigation team had to persuade him to relax.
Informed that the investigation team was investigating a smuggling case, Burnt Umber became even more nervous. Even though the production team did not ask, he confessed a lot: this year, he asked a friend working in §2Fluttershy Harbour§! to help him buy Free Equestria’s ice cream and cola at a low price, not sure if it counts as smuggling; two years ago, he was given two boxes of apple cider by a merchant at §2Applejack Harbour§!, and drank them all that night, not sure if it counts as bribery. In his nervousness, he even told the investigation team his favorite dessert flavor: vanilla. A few years ago, he stole a few fragrant herbs from the §2Freight Bureau’s warehouse§! and brought them home to grow.
Regarding §2his relationship with Blossom Burst§!, Burnt Umber said that he used to be neighbors with Blossom Burst in the Peaks of Peril, and they had some exchanges. Even though he was not clear about Blossom Burst’s current situation, he believed that Blossom Burst was unlikely to be a smuggler. However, when the investigation team asked why, §2he could not give a clear reason§!.
At the very last, Burnt Umber, who had calmed down, finally remembered to remind the investigation team that he had checked the logs of the border inspection forces in the border areas, and there was no record of a Kirin with a similar appearance to Blossom Burst crossing or illegally crossing the border. This means that §2Blossom Burst may not have left the country§!, but is still hiding within the Kirin commune, possibly fled north to the §2Kirin Forest§!, or in the worst case scenario —— has been silenced for good.

[en.EVENT_C18_MAIN_32_o0]
File Archived

[en.EVENT_C18_MAIN_33]
Talk Record: Burnt Umber

[en.EVENT_C18_MAIN_33_desc]
Burnt Umber, §2Kirin military leader§!, born in the Peaks of Peril, currently residing in the §2Peaks of Peril§!.

As a military leader, Burnt Umber seems to lack the ability to deal with serious conversation. Seeing the investigation team coming, Burnt Umber was very §2nervous and stuttered§!. He seemed to mistake the investigation team for some examiners, and kept emphasizing his loyalty and execution. Because the §2military he led did not participate in§! the transfer of the foal’s breath to the east, his answer to most of our routine questions was “I don’t know”. This made him even more nervous, and the investigation team had to persuade him to relax.
